{"id":"start","lemma":"Start","pos":"noun","rank":2078,"glosses":["start (beginning of a project)","start (beginning point of a race)","takeoff, liftoff (beginning of a flight)"],"ipa":"/ʃtaʁt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6a/De-at-Start.ogg/De-at-Start.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Startes","plural":"Starts"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir hatten einen schlechten Start.","en":"We got off to a bad start.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"bad","l":"schlecht"},null]},{"text":"Der offizielle Start ist Montag.","en":"The official start is on Monday.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"official","l":"offiziell"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"Monday"}]},{"text":"Der Läufer hatte einen guten Start.","en":"The runner got a good start.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"to walk","l":"laufen"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Wir hatten einen sehr guten Start.","en":"We had a really good start.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Wir haben einen schlechten Start hingelegt.","en":"We got off to a bad start.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"bad","l":"schlecht"},null,{"g":"to put down, lay down","l":"hinlegen"}]}]}